      "text": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>Mega Beedrill can be considered the \"starter\" Mega of PoGo since they give you this Mega for free; whether you be a new player or one that's been around since 2016.</p><p>So to take down the starter Mega, why not use some fully-evolved Fire starters of our own? Especially since both are so easily accessible?</p><p><br></p><p><em>(Disclaimer: While I did run Low Kick as the Fast Move for Emboar, Ember is generally the better Fast Move for it on this solo)</em></p><h4>Est Time to Win</h4><p>260-270 seconds</p><h2>Main Strategy</h2><p>Time your dodges and relobby if needed. Pretty straightforward.</p><h2>Video Credits</h2><p><br></p>",
